{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find, take, move and inspect an object; perform task if applicable. Scan area if unsuccessful. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsDestinationReached    /> <Action ID = InspectObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
